# Tangent on an empty sketch: a circle K1, a segment L1 from a point P2 on
# its rim (on(P2, K1) kept), and a segment L2 above it. Tangent, tool
# first, on P2, L1 and K1: tangent_at(L1, K1, P2, -1), L1 leaving P2
# downwards where K1 turns upwards. On the selection of L2 and K1, which
# lies on L2's right: tangent(L2, K1, -1).
open tests/data/sketch-blank.json
wait 16
action tool.circle
wait 2
click L 579 339
click L 689 339
action tool.segment
wait 2
click L 689 339
click L 716 503
click L 415 175
click L 743 202
key Escape
key Escape
wait 2
action tool.tangent
wait 2
click L 689 339
click L 702 421
click L 579 449
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
select element L2 element K1
action tool.tangent
wait 4
